+// Change M1 (scratch, study2f_horizontalAir; opt-in, updateVariables.H): air
+// mobility of the porous/free Darcy faces weighted by the air fraction of the free
+// cell, 1 - alpha. Air passes between the pore space of a yarn and a free cell only
+// through the part of the free cell that is air: a yarn's air does not enter the
+// water of a gap or bath cell (that would take the bubble entry pressure
+// 2 sigma/r_pore, tens of kPa for micrometre pores), and a water-filled free cell
+// has no air to give. Without the keyword the solver is unchanged.
+const Switch porousFreeAirFraction
+(
+    transportProperties.lookupOrDefault<Switch>("porousFreeAirFraction", false)
+);
+if (porousFreeAirFraction)
+{
+    Info<< "porousFreeAirFraction: air mobility of the porous/free Darcy faces "
+        << "weighted by the air fraction (1 - alpha) of the free cell" << endl;
+}
 surfaceScalarField porousFace("porousFace", Solidf);
